..> Here if i want to add somthing to this array  here in this case :
$ push : Adds ann element to an Array  { In this case duplication can happens }
$ pop : Removes the first or last element of an Array.
$ pull : Removes all elements from an Array that match the query.
$ addToSet : Adds distinct elements to an Array  
# here first it checks in the arrays , if it is not there, then only its adds the element to teh arrays 
#  Not allows any duplications

