To increment an value here in this case :
db.Myinfo22.updateMany(
  { name: "Banu" },
  { $inc: { age: 2 } }
)

To multiply an value here in this case:
db.Myinfo22.updateOne(
  {name:'Banu'},
  {$mul: {age:2}}
)

To remove the complete an age filed for the Banu the we use :
db.Myinfo22.updateOne(
{name: 'Banu'},
{ $unset :{age:""} }
)

To rename the fileds in the collections we use the $rename operator:
db.MySkills.updateMany(
  {},   // filter (empty means all documents)
  { $rename: { "skills": "coding_skills" } }
)

To update the fields in the collection with an column here and with the todays date :
db.MySkills.updateMany(
{},
{ $currentDate : { "lastModified":true } }
);
.> here currentDate this is the operator
.> lastmodifeid field is the column name

To update the fileds by using the min and max operator's:
db.Myinfo22.updateOne{
{name:"sachin"},
{$min: {age:20} },
);
here the age field will be updated with the 20, if the real age filed value were having less then 20.
here the min operator compares the old and new values , and and keeps which one is less , 

db.Myinfo22.updateOne{
{name:"sachin"},
{$max: {age:90} }
)
here the max operator compares the old and new values , and and keeps which one is more  

To add new elements to the array then we use the 
,db.MySkills.updateOne(
  {name:"Sachin"},
  {$push:{"my_skills":"pyshco"}}
) 

To add new elements to the arrays but, previously if it is not available then it will be added , 
or else it will be ignored.
db.MySkills.updateOne(
  {name:"Sachin"},
  {$addToSet:{"my_skills":"Generative_Ai"}}
)

To delete the elements from the Array, we use the pop
db.MySkills.updateOne(
{ name: "Sachin" },
{ $pop: { "my_skills": [ here we can use 1, -1]} }
);
if i use 1 then it iwll delete last element .
If i use -1 tehn it will delete first element


To delete an particular elemet from the array then we use the
$pull 
db.MySkills.updateOne(
{name: "ramu"},
{$pull :{"my_skills":"nuva" }}
)

To delete multiple element from teh array we use this 
$pullAll
db.MySkills.updateOne(
{ name: "Sachin" },
{ $pullAll : {"my_skills": ["js","Ai"] } }
)

